#! Offering only the mandatory encoding. Distinguishes "negotiated utf-16
#! because it was asked for" from "defaulted to utf-16 because nothing was
#! asked for" — the two produce the same wire answer and must both be pinned,
#! or a server that ignored the field entirely would pass one of them.
name      lifecycle/negotiate-utf16-only
profile   utf16-only

initialize
shutdown
